# Collaboration Depth Query
# 基于 Wang & Zhang (2026) IJETHE 23:11

```dataview
TABLE project, checkpoint, delegation_intensity, cognitive_vigilance, cognitive_reallocation, zone, date
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "collaboration_record"
SORT project ASC, date DESC
```

## 区域分布

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  zone AS "Collaboration Zone",
  length(rows) AS "Count",
  round(length(rows) / length(filter(row.zone, (z) => z != null)) * 100, 1) AS "Percentage"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "collaboration_record"
WHERE zone != null
GROUP BY zone
```

## Zone 3 深度协作项目

```dataview
TABLE project, checkpoint, delegation_intensity, cognitive_vigilance, cognitive_reallocation
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "collaboration_record"
WHERE zone = "Zone 3"
SORT project ASC, date DESC
```

## 平均评分

```dataview
TABLE WITHOUT ID
  project AS "Project",
  round(mean(rows.delegation_intensity), 1) AS "Avg Delegation",
  round(mean(rows.cognitive_vigilance), 1) AS "Avg Vigilance",
  round(mean(rows.cognitive_reallocation), 1) AS "Avg Reallocation"
FROM "5_学术研究织网/研究项目"
WHERE type = "collaboration_record"
GROUP BY project
```